"{\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:5174/trajectory/puskonaladka?lang=en\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"stored\":\"en\",\"width\":375,\"scroll\":375,\"text\":\"Sign in\\nI’m commissioning a site\\n/\\nLearning paths\\nCommissioning · learning path\\nCommissioning TRASSIR OS at a site with up to 32 cameras\\n\\nDeploy and hand over a site with up to 32 cameras without escalating to support\\n\\nPath length\\n2 h 11 min\\n10 resources + assessment\\nAssessment\\n20 questions · required: 16 correct\\n30 minutes · 2 attempts · retry after 24 hr\\nOutcome\\nCertified TRASSIR OS Engineer\\nNamed concept document\\nStart learning path\\nSign in to save progress. You can read public resources now.\\nPath curriculum\\nAll 11 units\\n01\\nFirst startup and factory settings\\nResource\\n5 min\\n02\\nAdding an IP camera manually\\nResource\\n11 min\\n03\\nTRASSIR cannot discover an ONVIF camera: diagnostic sequence\\nResource\\n7 min\\n04\\nConfiguring recording retention on DuoStation\\nResource\\n12 min\\n05\\nOperator access rights\\nResource\\n10 min\\n06\\nConfiguring motion detectors\\nResource\\n15 min\\n07\\nRecording redundancy\\nResource\\n13 min\\n08\\nExporting a video clip for the customer\\nResource\\n9 min\\n09\\nChecking recording on every channel before handover\\nResource\\n12 min\\n10\\nSite handover document pack\\nResource\\n7 min\\n11\\nLearning path assessment\\nAssessment\\n30 min\\nWhat the result confirms\\n\\nThe certificate confirms that the engineer deploys TRASSIR OS at a site with up to 32 cameras: configures the server and network, connects cameras, sets archive retention and operator permissions, and completes site handover to the customer. Skills are tested in a 20-question assessment with a passing score of 16. Partner companies see the qualification in their company profile; individuals see it in their personal profile.\\n\\nAn independent learning concept. The document records completion in this prototype and does not award an official DSSL qualification.\\n\\nABOUT THE PLATFORM\\nHow learning works\\nPartner certification\\nContact\\nTRASSIR PRODUCTS\\nTRASSIR OS\\nDuoStation\\nCamera range\\nVideo analytics\\nSUPPORT\\nKnowledge base\\nContact support\\nService status\\nDSSL · TRASSIR Learn — learning platform for partners\",\"cyrillic\":null}"

